<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-20T03:38:28.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:38:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces conducted raids on militant hideouts, killing 74 militants in one operation and 22 militants in another, while the army reported the attacks as targeting TTP elements. A passenger coach collided with an LPG bowser on the Makran coastal highway near Ormara, killing ten civilians, and a separate bus-gas tanker crash killed ten people elsewhere in Pakistan. The Pakistani minister travelled to India for a SCO meeting, though no breakthrough was expected, and senior military commander CDF Munir was briefed on ongoing operations during a visit to Balochistan. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOb21CVUxCSWdXZll3OThPOWdNZXFfMTFKaUY4cnVFU082VlEteW1CX0J2NTNQZk5TWXlwaUlXZjNrSG1lcmRjdlFYWXRzdTg1dTJvM3UtbTN3b0dxNGVobmZpdHNldTEzcFZuSWRqdEg5ZHJYMTFrZXJBT1BIZDFKd0NWbDlTNkFtbF91TEZsamY?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBSazJyYW5uVi1GMUZReTlsQ0dRanUtMVBSMFRFaU04eW80aF9BZ1ZKTEduWEVxcmZKY3laRElJZEZVSzVucW1lRg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5jV21NeGxVVjhQcHNpMVdaTzg2S1hsNFlfSll2cUpYWTFlWjNEdzYxWDVjanFOeDlEX19DZ3pTOGlFWlZOSkhvOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBKTlJHU2lTellGaUxMdndWQldIazBvb05CdG0xNXR4a3ZmWVBBNHQ0NmJpZ3RvVkdxb2VjTC16YUtXUnNJYTZCcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
